{"data": {"__GLOBAL": {"_ATTACH_BASE_VIEW": "img.nga.cn/attachments"}, "__U": {"150058": {"uid": 150058, "username": "UID:150058", "credit": 135537154, "medal": "272,207,157,92", "reputation": "28_30,61_0,147_775,130_10", "groupid": -1, "memberid": 73, "avatar": null, "yz": 4, "site": null, "honor": null, "regdate": 1123989606, "mute_time": null, "postnum": 42229, "rvrc": 29, "money": 90765, "thisvisit": 1788178932, "signature": null, "nickname": null, "bit_data": 135537154}, "__GROUPS": {"73": ["学徒", 360672, 73]}, "__MEDALS": {"272": ["272.gif", "棒棒糖", "叔叔请你吃棒棒糖", 272], "207": ["207.gif", "爆竹声中旧岁除", "一支红杏出墙来", 207], "157": ["157.gif", "王者之剑", "王者之剑活动纪念", 157], "92": ["92.gif", "小心死亡之翼-", "2011年大灾变开服纪念", 92]}, "__REPUTATIONS": {"147": {"150058": 775, "0": "大时代"}}}, "__R": [{"pid": 880269433, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 56, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-09-01 10:21", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=880269192,47288722,1808]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=67208424]tpx10086[/uid] (2026-09-01 10:19):[/b]<br/><br/>但是狼大，过完七月八月，真的还敢抄科技吗[s:ac:喷]如果不在楼里，我感觉我会死在追高的路上，只敢买涨不敢买跌[/quote]<br/>你看目前  黄线在上 指数准备突破 科技看起来企稳了  大哥准备接近出水面<br/>整体微微放量  金融也没搞幺蛾子<br/><br/>多么完美的盘面啊。", "lou": 680, "content_length": 113, "reply_to": 880269192, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1788229269}, {"pid": 880270261, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 54, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-09-01 10:27", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=880269834,47288722,1810]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=15541309]小李飞刀成绝响[/uid] (2026-09-01 10:24):[/b]<br/><br/>狼大，那为啥早上主力不顺势稍微做个诱多，而是一开盘直接砸啊，而且砸这么厉害，谁敢进科技啊，还是说砸的是前两天买科技的？[/quote]<br/>平开不就是诱多了么<br/>涨起来散户哪里敢买<br/>但是跌下来糖葫芦战法就用上了。", "lou": 681, "content_length": 71, "reply_to": 880269834, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1788229629}, {"pid": 880271163, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 38, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-09-01 10:34", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=880270304,47288722,1811]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=64786164]XX的小迷弟[/uid] (2026-09-01 10:27):[/b]<br/><br/>按狼大的意思，我没觉得要补涨，是不是已经脱离散户的范围了？[s:ac:哭笑][/quote]<br/>你不要看我这里  用你自己的本心 或者你看看别的没看我的散户看看。", "lou": 682, "content_length": 65, "reply_to": 880270304, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1788230041}, {"pid": 880272452, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 49, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-09-01 10:43", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=880271918,47288722,1813]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=40888433]deeamarke[/uid] (2026-09-01 10:39):[/b]<br/><br/>狼大是不是看高散户了，一般散户哪里看得懂盘面，补涨这些，追涨杀跌才是散户常态[/quote]<br/>纯散户那种有什么好诱的  他们都在公墓和ETF里面  顺手的事<br/>现在诱的是那种假装自己能看懂的 这种人才是目标。", "lou": 683, "content_length": 102, "reply_to": 880271918, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1788230596}, {"pid": 880272903, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 73, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-09-01 10:46", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=880272679,47288722,1813]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=15541309]小李飞刀成绝响[/uid] (2026-09-01 10:44):[/b]<br/><br/>那要这么说的话，短时间科技估计也不可能拉回来了吧，散户喜欢装死<br/>也就是说这两天都不是t科技的机会，这么理解可以吗[/quote]<br/>我在等一个机会  <br/>一旦科技日内V反 你就知道多有吸引力了。<br/>我不是很急。这里需要有足够的差价。", "lou": 684, "content_length": 90, "reply_to": 880272679, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1788230783}, {"pid": 880274424, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 43, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-09-01 10:56", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=880274199,47288722,1815]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=1305675]苍地哥[/uid] (2026-09-01 10:54):[/b]<br/><br/>难道这个盘面你还在做科技的差价？<br/>火中取栗这种操作不像你的风格啊[/quote]<br/>我几乎完美的做了一个月的半导体的T  我怕什么", "lou": 685, "content_length": 46, "reply_to": 880274199, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1788231361}, {"pid": 880275203, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 48, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-09-01 11:01", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "感觉差不多了  不管是时间还是幅度  <br/>希望上午就有个好位置。", "lou": 686, "content_length": 52, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1788231665}, {"pid": 880275383, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 43, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-09-01 11:02", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=880275269,47288722,1816]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=1353185]等爬墙的红杏[/uid] (2026-09-01 11:01):[/b]<br/><br/>这个差价是不是170起码要比昨天低点还要低？[/quote]<br/>我感觉差不多了  不是这里也差不多了。我在慢慢打进去了", "lou": 687, "content_length": 55, "reply_to": 880275269, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1788231732}, {"pid": 880276095, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 61, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-09-01 11:07", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "你们敢买锦龙真是比我强太多了 我是不敢的。<br/>我都是埋伏 只是我埋伏的有我的道理。", "lou": 688, "content_length": 74, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1788232047}, {"pid": 880276661, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 39, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-09-01 11:11", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=880276284,47288722,1818]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=62771233]极地丶之光[/uid] (2026-09-01 11:08):[/b]<br/><br/>主要还是狼大说的券商可能会领涨指数，早上看到有人翘板就跟了[/quote]<br/>嗯 符合超短打法<br/>不过我的短线是另外一种玩法  不一样。", "lou": 689, "content_length": 53, "reply_to": 880276284, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1788232279}, {"pid": 880278186, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 58, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-09-01 11:21", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=880278010,47288722,1821]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=15541309]小李飞刀成绝响[/uid] (2026-09-01 11:20):[/b]<br/><br/>狼大，作为一个散户来说，科技赚钱效应越来越差，即使科技跌到位了，散户大概率也是不敢买的，这时候感觉宁愿去买一些低位慢慢可能涨起来的老登，也不愿意在科技承受这么大的难度了[s:ac:哭笑][/quote]<br/>没事  日内V反一下就能回来钱了  <br/>我现在就是玩这个 等你们回来 我就出给大家。", "lou": 690, "content_length": 72, "reply_to": 880278010, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1788232903}, {"pid": 880279075, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 42, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-09-01 11:27", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=880278886,47288722,1822]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=15541309]小李飞刀成绝响[/uid] (2026-09-01 11:26):[/b]<br/><br/>这个确实，看到上涨的时候，是散户最容易动心的时候，下跌的时候不是，下跌的时候是最容易割肉的时候[s:pg:哭][/quote]<br/>嘿嘿<br/>看吧 准备开始躁动咯[s:ac:哭笑]", "lou": 691, "content_length": 25, "reply_to": 880278886, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1788233251}, {"pid": 880279345, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 84, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-09-01 11:29", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "你们也懂做T？[s:ac:反对]<br/>菜死了 <br/><br/>你们别玩了  等被收割吧[s:ac:闪光]", "lou": 692, "content_length": 35, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1788233355}, {"pid": 880279593, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 96, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-09-01 11:30", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "都到这个位置了  不过4000怎么诱多 甚至我觉得还能逗留一段时间 慢慢让你们知道4000收费站的威力[s:ac:计划通]<br/><br/>你们说你们菜不菜", "lou": 693, "content_length": 100, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1788233453}, {"pid": 880284577, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 150058, "type": 0, "score": 88, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-09-01 12:11", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "大跌为什么要看见我  你们被别人带的还不够吗  -10%-20%-30%的 我就没必要掺一脚了啊<br/>我只负责挣钱就行[s:ac:哭笑]<br/><br/>笑死了  大跌的时候来吹<br/>这种话到底过不过脑子啊", "lou": 694, "content_length": 130, "from_client": "0 /", "postdatetimestamp": 1788235886}, {"pid": 880285174, 